    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt offer for sale this deceptively spacious 3 bedroom detached bungalow enjoying a fabulous location in the historic and picturesque Heritage town of Lismore. Beautifully maintained and presented throughout, this delightful home offers prospective purchasers a superb turnkey opportunity in one of West Waterford's most sought after locations. The property is approached via a cobblelock driveway providing ample off street car parking and is complemented by attractive low maintenance landscaping. A gated side entrance leads to a private enclosed low maintenance rear garden perfect for outdoor relaxation and entertaining. The location of this home is second to none, with Lismore town's centre and a full range of local amenities just a short stroll away. The property offers an ideal commuter base being within an easy drive of Dungarvan, Fermoy, Youghal, Clonmel Towns and within a one hours of Cork City. The town is also served by a regular TFI Local Link service, offering convenient daily public transport links to surrounding towns. The deceptive accommodation extending to 84sq.m comprises: Entrance hallway, sitting room, kitchen, three bedrooms and bathroom.\n\nREA Spratt highly recommend viewing of this home.\n \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\n6.00m x 1.50m Tiled floor, hot press with shelving off\n\nSitting Room\n4.90m x 3.60m Timber floor, wood burning stove connected to central heating. Genrous bay window\n\nKitchen\n4.20m x 3.00m Tiled floor, floor and eye level units incorporating integrated appliances. Door to rear garden.\n\nBedroom 1\n3.80m x 2.90m\nMeasurement excludes built in wardrobes. Timber floor\n\nBedroom 2\n3.60m x 3.50m Timber floor, built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3\n3.00m x 2.50m Timber floor\n\nBathroom\n2.40m x 1.70m Floor and walls fully tiled, Triton T90xr electric shower\n\n\nOutside\n-Cobble lock hard landscaping to the front. -Gated entry to private enclosed rear garden with timber garden shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-Stira stairs to floored attic space\n-Solar panels to minimise utility bills \n-Dual central heating \n-Private corner site\n-Turnkey condition throughout\nAll floor covering, all window furnishings, all light fittings and integrated appliances \n All main services to include water and sewerage.\nOil fired and solid fuel central heating. \n All amenities of Lismore Town on the doorstep."
      },
